WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:12.934
Bird found a lot of worms.

2
00:00:12.935 --> 00:00:21.811
Soon she was ready

3
00:00:21.812 --> 00:00:24.743
to meet Kip. Bird flew

4
00:00:24.744 --> 00:00:26.718
to the beach.

5
00:00:26.719 --> 00:00:31.502
She looked all over. But Bird didn't see Kip

6
00:00:31.503 --> 00:00:34.603
anywhere. "Where is Kip?" said Bird.

7
00:00:34.604 --> 00:00:36.513
Bird flew back to the

8
00:00:36.514 --> 00:00:39.451
park. And then she saw Kip! Kip

9
00:00:39.452 --> 00:00:41.783
was doing push-ups. "Kip!"

10
00:00:41.784 --> 00:00:45.242
said Bird. "Why aren't

11
00:00:45.243 --> 00:00:48.855
you at the beach?" Kip stood

12
00:00:48.856 --> 00:00:53.205
up. "I'm training," he said.

13
00:00:53.206 --> 00:00:55.229
He did jumping jacks.

14
00:00:55.230 --> 00:01:01.864
"What are you training for?" asked Bird. "There's

15
00:01:01.865 --> 00:01:06.359
a big race

16
00:01:06.360 --> 00:01:09.720
tomorrow," said Kip. "I'm going to win!" Kip

17
00:01:09.721 --> 00:01:12.010
sat down and

18
00:01:12.011 --> 00:01:14.454
stretched. He tried to touch his toes.

19
00:01:14.455 --> 00:01:17.768
Then he got up

20
00:01:17.769 --> 00:01:28.290
and ran. Kip ran to

21
00:01:28.291 --> 00:01:31.688
the playground. "You're very fast,"

22
00:01:31.689 --> 00:01:37.151
said Bird. "Yes, I am," called Kip.

23
00:01:37.152 --> 00:01:42.058
Kip ran back to Bird. He panted hard.

24
00:01:42.059 --> 00:01:46.285
"I'm going . . . to win .

25
00:01:46.286 --> 00:01:54.148
. . the big race!"

